WEBVTT

00:09.780 --> 00:12.760
Okay, kids! Take your seats.

00:14.400 --> 00:16.450
I'd like to introduce our 
new transfer student.

00:17.240 --> 00:20.330
I-I'll be your classmate starting today.

00:20.330 --> 00:22.790
M-My name's Mahiro Oyama.

00:23.200 --> 00:27.450
P-Please bear with me while 
I get used to everything.

00:27.460 --> 00:32.750
Mahiro Oyama

00:27.870 --> 00:32.760
I-It's nice to meet you all!

00:33.160 --> 00:35.630
Welcome to the class!

00:36.620 --> 00:40.390
Okay then, your seat is by the 
window, furthest to the back.

00:41.480 --> 00:43.390
<i>Why... Wh-Wh-Why—</i>

00:43.390 --> 00:47.110
<i>Why am I even here?!</i>

00:59.740 --> 01:00.820
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:01.320 --> 01:02.450
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:04.620 --> 01:07.750
<b>Mahiro Oyama</b>

01:10.920 --> 01:13.960
<b>Mihari Oyama</b>

02:08.770 --> 02:17.070
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

02:17.570 --> 02:22.610
<b>#06 Mahiro Goes Back to Middle School</b>

02:20.830 --> 02:26.130
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh...

02:27.220 --> 02:29.240
Wh-Who are they?!

02:29.240 --> 02:30.890
Sorry we startled you!

02:30.890 --> 02:33.870
My friends and I were just on 
our way to a parfait place,

02:33.870 --> 02:36.250
so we were wondering if you'd 
like to come with us.

02:37.580 --> 02:38.460
Par—?!

02:38.460 --> 02:40.060
You don't say...

02:40.060 --> 02:43.450
Aw, sorry, but I actually have plans—

02:44.630 --> 02:46.800
Isn't that nice, Mahiro-chan?!

02:46.800 --> 02:48.750
You were just telling me you 
had nothing else to do today!

02:48.750 --> 02:49.890
What are you...?

02:51.180 --> 02:53.040
Here! This should cover the parfait.

02:53.040 --> 02:54.240
R-Right...

02:54.520 --> 02:56.840
Perfect! She's all yours, Momiji-chan!

02:56.840 --> 02:57.910
Sure!

02:57.910 --> 03:00.100
Come on, let's get going!

03:00.970 --> 03:04.260
But wait! Hold on a sec! Mihari!

03:04.260 --> 03:05.690
Have fun, you guys!

03:14.570 --> 03:16.090
Let me introduce you guys!

03:16.090 --> 03:18.380
These are my classmates. Miyo-chan and...

03:18.380 --> 03:19.960
I'm Asahi!

03:20.330 --> 03:22.580
I'm M-Mahiro.

03:23.140 --> 03:25.130
Nice to meet you.

03:26.510 --> 03:28.710
Back off a bit, Mahiro-chan!

03:28.710 --> 03:30.130
Oh! Sorry!

03:33.430 --> 03:36.050
<i>I'd heard they were close, but...</i>

03:37.710 --> 03:38.470
Huh?

03:37.710 --> 03:38.470
Hm?

03:40.540 --> 03:44.420
So, Mahiron. Momiji's already 
given us the lowdown on you.

03:44.420 --> 03:45.740
Mahiron?

03:45.740 --> 03:48.690
She told us how cute and funny you were!

03:50.870 --> 03:52.420
Not to mention...

03:53.220 --> 03:56.130
that you're a good-for-nothing slob 
who's scared of strangers!

03:58.380 --> 04:00.780
That's not what I told them at all!

04:00.780 --> 04:03.930
She doesn't mean it, I promise...

04:10.470 --> 04:12.090
Mahiro-chan?

04:12.090 --> 04:13.840
It's fine, really!

04:13.840 --> 04:15.420
Besides, she's not wrong.

04:15.420 --> 04:18.970
This is better than having to 
pretend to be something I'm not.

04:20.990 --> 04:23.550
It's actually a huge relief, to be honest.

04:23.550 --> 04:25.520
Awesome! Glad I could help.

04:25.520 --> 04:27.950
You didn't help one bit.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.640
Sorry Asahi's being such a dingus.

04:30.640 --> 04:32.320
Wow, harsh!

04:36.200 --> 04:38.950
Well, we've known each other since 
elementary school, you know?

04:38.950 --> 04:40.040
Yup!

04:41.110 --> 04:42.560
Don't fret, okay?

04:42.560 --> 04:44.650
They're just kinda stuck with 
each other, that's all.

04:45.550 --> 04:47.160
Am I missing something?

04:48.360 --> 04:50.090
Sorry for the wait.

04:52.170 --> 04:54.160
Hey, look at that!

04:54.860 --> 04:57.900
Wow! They're like the perfect fall treat.

04:57.900 --> 04:59.660
Whoa!

04:59.660 --> 05:01.990
They have so many flavors here.

05:01.990 --> 05:04.600
I think this is my first time trying one!

05:07.970 --> 05:10.540
Here, say "ah"!

05:10.930 --> 05:11.770
Huh?

05:12.430 --> 05:15.300
You can try a bite of mine 
as an apology for earlier.

05:16.540 --> 05:18.630
Huh? Oh...

05:19.410 --> 05:21.450
Ahh...

05:24.450 --> 05:27.030
You can try mine instead!

05:30.520 --> 05:32.910
Isn't it yummy, Mahiro-chan?

05:33.370 --> 05:35.720
Mine tastes yummy too, Mahiron!

05:35.720 --> 05:38.200
H-Hey!

05:35.720 --> 05:39.430
Well, mine tastes yummier!

05:40.570 --> 05:43.250
<i>Thank you for this meal.</i>

05:44.350 --> 05:46.670
Thank you!

05:49.450 --> 05:52.340
Man, I'm stuffed.

05:52.340 --> 05:53.400
Same!

05:53.400 --> 05:55.610
I'm glad you liked it!

05:58.430 --> 06:02.180
Sorry to butt in on your friend 
group, by the way.

06:03.600 --> 06:05.920
But you're our friend too, Mahiron.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.710
We should hang out again sometime!

06:12.080 --> 06:15.050
Sure thing. I'm looking forward to it.

06:15.570 --> 06:16.780
See you later!

06:17.590 --> 06:18.940
Bye-bye!

06:18.240 --> 06:19.580
Bye-bye!

06:33.060 --> 06:34.380
Mahiro-chan!

06:38.450 --> 06:40.470
I'm rooting for you, okay?!

06:45.110 --> 06:47.080
<i>I-Is she okay...?</i>

06:49.760 --> 06:51.580
I'm home!

06:51.930 --> 06:53.920
Welcome home, Onii-chan!

06:53.920 --> 06:55.880
How was your girls' day out?

06:56.450 --> 06:58.520
Girls' day out, huh?

06:58.520 --> 07:00.950
The parfait was pretty good, I guess.

07:01.410 --> 07:03.480
Hey, that's good!

07:03.910 --> 07:07.380
Say, why don't you go ahead and 
take a bath before dinner?

07:20.250 --> 07:23.010
I wonder when I'll see them again...

07:36.360 --> 07:39.220
Now to get dressed...

07:39.220 --> 07:39.990
Hm?

07:48.740 --> 07:51.710
This uniform looks familiar, somehow...

07:51.710 --> 07:53.120
Yay!

07:53.120 --> 07:56.450
My old uniform fits you like a glove!

07:56.450 --> 07:59.170
I'm not interested in being your 
dress-up doll again, okay?

08:03.780 --> 08:06.500
Onii-chan, would you sit 
down with me for a moment?

08:07.800 --> 08:09.230
What's going on?

08:12.590 --> 08:14.950
I wasn't sure about this either,

08:14.950 --> 08:17.430
but the drug's effects won't 
wear off for a while yet,

08:17.430 --> 08:20.130
and you've already started 
to make new friends.

08:20.570 --> 08:22.500
Friends?

08:22.500 --> 08:25.100
I've already come up with a 
cover story and everything.

08:25.100 --> 08:26.180
A cover story?

08:28.120 --> 08:30.950
W-Wait, don't tell me...

08:31.700 --> 08:34.610
You're going back to school, Onii-chan!

08:45.070 --> 08:48.940
<i>And that's how I ended up in this mess.</i>

08:48.940 --> 08:51.770
<i>I really should have put my foot down more.</i>

08:51.770 --> 08:55.550
<i>Who would've thought I'd have 
to relive middle school...</i>

08:56.400 --> 08:59.310
<i>and as a girl, no less?</i>

09:03.370 --> 09:05.130
Hey, can we talk?

09:05.130 --> 09:06.960
You're so cute!

09:06.960 --> 09:08.190
Your hair's pretty, too!

09:08.190 --> 09:09.890
Tell us where you're from!

09:09.890 --> 09:13.320
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh...

09:14.700 --> 09:16.260
Come on, guys!

09:16.260 --> 09:19.200
If you all come at her at once, 
she'll never get a word in.

09:21.970 --> 09:24.990
Right, Mahiro-chan?

09:26.830 --> 09:30.170
Momiji-sama!

09:31.040 --> 09:33.740
Oh? Do you two know each other, Hozuki-san?

09:33.740 --> 09:36.430
Yup! I'll introduce you all later.

09:36.790 --> 09:37.960
Gotcha.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.660
Sorry about that, Oyama-san.

09:39.660 --> 09:40.350
Bummer.

09:40.350 --> 09:41.320
Let's go, guys.

09:40.880 --> 09:42.350
Maybe next time.

09:42.910 --> 09:45.900
I-I'm free.

09:45.900 --> 09:48.160
This was a huge surprise to me too, you know?

09:48.160 --> 09:49.720
Mahiron!

09:49.720 --> 09:52.040
I didn't know we were 
going to be classmates!

09:52.040 --> 09:53.390
Same!

09:53.390 --> 09:56.640
Actually, it was a surprise to me, too.

09:57.020 --> 09:59.120
Still, I had no idea.

09:59.120 --> 10:02.770
Must have been tough dropping out and 
being homeschooled due to your health.

10:03.180 --> 10:03.890
Huh?

10:04.560 --> 10:07.440
<i>Oh, was that the cover 
story Mihari mentioned?</i>

10:07.440 --> 10:11.060
Yeah, it was. I'm all better now, though.

10:11.060 --> 10:12.470
Are you sure you're okay?

10:12.470 --> 10:14.570
You look a little pale...

10:14.570 --> 10:16.150
Don't worry, I'm fine!

10:16.150 --> 10:18.130
It's probably just a lack of sleep.

10:18.530 --> 10:21.420
School does start pretty early, huh?

10:21.420 --> 10:23.230
Gotta be rough for a slob like you.

10:26.180 --> 10:29.220
Let me share some of my 
energy with you, then!

10:29.760 --> 10:30.680
Hm?

10:31.620 --> 10:32.850
Squeeze.

10:33.150 --> 10:36.690
Hug, hug, hug, hug, hug...

10:33.150 --> 10:38.570
Hug

10:33.150 --> 10:38.570
Hug

10:33.150 --> 10:38.570
Hug

10:35.530 --> 10:38.570
Waaaaaah

10:37.740 --> 10:38.570
Hug

10:39.050 --> 10:41.820
<i>Smells just like a summer breeze...</i>

10:42.720 --> 10:44.770
Get off of her, Asahi!

10:45.270 --> 10:47.700
There, there. You too, Momiji.

10:54.880 --> 10:57.120
Asahi's pretty friendly, huh?

10:57.120 --> 10:59.890
Yeah, she can get pretty 
touchy-feely sometimes.

10:59.890 --> 11:01.570
Come on, Miyo-chin. Bring it in!

11:01.570 --> 11:03.580
N-No need. I'm good!

11:03.580 --> 11:06.260
I prefer to watch, anyway!

11:08.610 --> 11:11.540
<i>Never a dull moment with these guys, huh?</i>

11:14.060 --> 11:14.480
<b>ONIMAI</b>

11:14.460 --> 11:15.630
<i>Onimai.</i>

11:14.480 --> 11:14.730
<b>ONIMAI</b>

11:14.730 --> 11:14.940
<b>ONIMAI</b>

11:14.940 --> 11:16.060
<b>ONIMAI</b>

11:16.750 --> 11:21.000
Once upon a time, there lived 
an old bamboo cutter.

11:21.000 --> 11:24.920
<i>After that, I made it through 
class without getting called on.</i>

11:21.330 --> 11:24.920
Every day, he would make his way 
into the fields and mountains...

11:24.920 --> 11:27.010
<i>And though I had been dreading break time,</i>

11:27.010 --> 11:30.750
<i>it went by pretty peacefully with 
Momiji and the others by my side.</i>

11:35.470 --> 11:38.760
I-I made it through unscathed.

11:39.760 --> 11:41.130
Mahiro-chan!

11:41.620 --> 11:42.580
Huh?

11:42.820 --> 11:44.310
Let's walk home together!

11:44.780 --> 11:46.100
Sure!

11:49.810 --> 11:52.220
So how was your first day back, Mahiro-chan?

11:52.220 --> 11:54.150
Were you nervous?

11:54.150 --> 11:56.760
You guys helped me out so much!

11:57.100 --> 12:00.200
I don't know what I would 
have done without you!

12:03.720 --> 12:05.930
Be right back! Gotta use the restroom!

12:14.070 --> 12:15.730
Gotta go, gotta go!

12:40.490 --> 12:41.620
Mahiro-chan?!

12:41.620 --> 12:44.070
Wh-What are you doing?

12:44.070 --> 12:46.280
Girls' bathroom's this way.

12:49.030 --> 12:51.510
<i>Damn, that was a close call.</i>

12:51.510 --> 12:53.220
<i>Gotta be more careful.</i>

12:56.880 --> 12:58.930
Why'd you guys follow me in here?

12:59.750 --> 13:01.720
What d'ya mean, why?

13:09.050 --> 13:11.200
<i>Oh, right...</i>

13:11.200 --> 13:13.620
<i>Girls go to the bathroom together, huh?</i>

13:14.110 --> 13:16.520
<i>I don't think I have the guts for that.</i>

13:21.610 --> 13:25.300
The desserts they have are really good, too!

13:25.300 --> 13:27.230
You should come with us 
next time, Mahiro-chan!

13:27.230 --> 13:28.360
Yeah, you should!

13:28.710 --> 13:30.390
Almost there...

13:30.720 --> 13:32.640
Almost there...

13:32.640 --> 13:35.500
Almost there, almost there, almost there.

13:35.500 --> 13:38.230
Almost... Almost...

13:38.230 --> 13:39.410
Are you even listening?

13:39.820 --> 13:40.880
Huh?

13:41.270 --> 13:43.350
Your house is right there, Mahiro-chan.

13:44.290 --> 13:49.220
Oyama

13:47.030 --> 13:49.220
Just in time...

13:49.570 --> 13:50.540
See ya!

13:50.940 --> 13:51.740
Yeah!

13:51.740 --> 13:53.780
See you tomorrow, Mahiro-chan!

14:07.340 --> 14:08.950
See you tomorrow...

14:10.470 --> 14:12.870
Wait! Now's not the time!

14:13.460 --> 14:16.740
Gotta go, gotta go, gotta go!

14:16.740 --> 14:18.450
Welcome home, Onii-cha—

14:34.050 --> 14:36.100
<b>ONIMAI</b>

14:34.360 --> 14:35.510
<i>Onimai.</i>

14:38.430 --> 14:40.100
<b>ONIMAI</b>

14:38.880 --> 14:40.110
<i>Onimai.</i>

14:43.700 --> 14:46.630
Ugh, this sucks...

14:47.460 --> 14:50.490
You say that, but you're 
already dressed and ready.

14:50.490 --> 14:54.930
B-But people would worry if I skipped 
the very next day, wouldn't they?!

14:55.770 --> 14:57.730
That's not the real reason, is it?

14:58.420 --> 15:00.320
Here, take your bag.

15:02.180 --> 15:03.950
Look! They're here to pick you up.

15:06.100 --> 15:08.020
Morning, Mahiro-chan!

15:08.880 --> 15:10.640
Your ribbon's crooked.

15:11.120 --> 15:12.580
Morning!

15:13.190 --> 15:14.840
Take care, now!

15:15.240 --> 15:15.890
Later!

15:15.890 --> 15:17.310
See you later!

15:17.950 --> 15:19.710
See you later!

15:28.290 --> 15:30.280
My bag's so heavy...

15:30.280 --> 15:33.100
Hang in there. You'll get used to it.

15:33.100 --> 15:34.880
Build up that stamina.

15:35.550 --> 15:38.500
Well? How's school been?

15:39.570 --> 15:42.610
I don't really know just yet...

15:43.390 --> 15:44.490
Gotcha!

15:44.490 --> 15:46.820
Mahiro-chan's quite popular, actually!

15:46.820 --> 15:47.810
Oh?

15:47.810 --> 15:48.840
What?

15:48.840 --> 15:49.790
I wouldn't say that...

15:49.790 --> 15:51.390
C'mon, own it!

15:51.390 --> 15:53.260
You won't be in middle school for long!

15:57.240 --> 15:59.700
I-I'm beat!

15:59.700 --> 16:01.250
Just let it be over!

16:02.240 --> 16:05.470
I should ask Mihari to get her license 
and have her drive me instead.

16:07.020 --> 16:11.010
At this rate, I'll have to 
start learning in my sleep.

16:11.650 --> 16:15.100
What's first period today, anyway?

16:15.300 --> 16:16.370
Let's get going.

16:16.370 --> 16:17.500
This'll be fun.

16:16.940 --> 16:19.040
Gym class, huh?

16:20.560 --> 16:22.690
So that's why my bag was so heavy.

16:26.040 --> 16:28.120
M-Mahiro-chan?!

16:28.120 --> 16:28.830
Hm?

16:35.930 --> 16:38.180
Wh-Whoops, sorry!

16:38.180 --> 16:39.900
Pull yourself together!

16:39.900 --> 16:41.220
Hey, boys! Quit staring!

16:41.220 --> 16:42.730
You jerks!

16:42.730 --> 16:44.150
I-I wasn't even looking!

16:44.510 --> 16:46.710
Sorry, my brethren.

16:46.710 --> 16:49.480
I'll make it up to you one day, I promise...

16:49.480 --> 16:51.300
Let's go, Mahiro-chan.

16:51.300 --> 16:52.780
Where are we going?

16:53.300 --> 16:54.160
Don't tell me—

16:55.070 --> 16:57.990
<b>Girls' Changing Room</b>

16:55.820 --> 16:57.130
Right?

16:57.980 --> 16:59.520
Same here!

16:59.520 --> 17:01.300
You've lost weight, haven't you?!

17:01.920 --> 17:02.790
You look great!

17:02.790 --> 17:05.220
<i>What fresh hell is this?!</i>

17:06.260 --> 17:09.320
I'm surrounded by half-naked schoolgirls.

17:09.320 --> 17:11.960
The whole place is a minefield!

17:12.820 --> 17:15.840
There's gotta be a safe 
place to look somewhere...

17:17.270 --> 17:21.040
Oh, the beckoning call 
of the flat, open plains.

17:22.600 --> 17:24.870
Truly a sight for sore eyes.

17:26.760 --> 17:28.980
Hang on. Where's Miyo-chan?

17:28.980 --> 17:31.310
I figured she'd love it in here.

17:34.520 --> 17:37.110
What are you doing, cooped 
up in the corner like that?

17:37.530 --> 17:45.490
<b>Girls' Changing Room</b>

17:41.460 --> 17:43.040
Mahiro-chan?

17:43.040 --> 17:44.980
M-Miyo-chan, yours are quite...

17:44.980 --> 17:46.850
Stop looking at them!

17:46.850 --> 17:49.500
I'm sorry!

17:53.940 --> 17:57.140
They tend to stand out in my gym 
clothes, so it's embarrassing.

17:57.140 --> 18:01.050
At least in winter, I can 
cover up with a tracksuit.

18:02.330 --> 18:04.920
So being stacked has its 
downsides, huh?

18:04.920 --> 18:07.060
Boobs are more complicated than I thought.

18:10.210 --> 18:11.370
Okay, kids!

18:11.370 --> 18:13.940
Let's start by splitting into 
pairs and doing warm-ups!

18:16.030 --> 18:18.230
I hate doing this!

18:18.230 --> 18:19.910
I'm so sorry!

18:24.110 --> 18:27.230
This is kinda embarrassing...

18:27.990 --> 18:29.940
Today's the day I take you down!

18:29.940 --> 18:31.670
I'd love to see you try!

18:31.670 --> 18:34.210
Those two seem to be having fun.

18:34.790 --> 18:37.690
They're both pretty athletic, after all.

18:37.690 --> 18:40.330
What are we doing after this, anyway?

18:40.330 --> 18:42.820
We're doing marathon training 
all month, apparently.

18:42.820 --> 18:44.270
Dread!

18:44.270 --> 18:46.260
No way!

18:47.040 --> 18:48.610
Gather round!

18:49.730 --> 18:52.760
Today, we'll be recording your 
times for the 1500-meter run.

18:53.280 --> 18:56.340
The dread is making me sick to my stomach.

18:53.820 --> 18:57.530
You'll be split into two teams:
 team one and team two.

18:56.340 --> 18:57.610
Are you all right?

18:57.530 --> 19:00.330
First, team one will run the lap 
while team two records their times.

18:57.610 --> 18:59.690
You still look a little pale.

19:00.320 --> 19:02.690
I think my tummy hurts a little.

19:00.330 --> 19:02.100
Then you'll switch sides.

19:02.100 --> 19:05.620
Remember to write down your heart 
rate before and after you run.

19:05.930 --> 19:06.980
Your recorded time—

19:05.930 --> 19:07.200
Excuse me!

19:06.980 --> 19:07.640
Hm?

19:12.350 --> 19:14.800
Miss, Oyama-san is...

19:15.960 --> 19:18.470
Oyama. You can sit out for today, okay?

19:16.520 --> 19:17.130
What's up?

19:17.130 --> 19:18.820
It's nothing.

19:18.820 --> 19:20.800
What? Really?

19:23.160 --> 19:25.840
I have no idea what happened, 
but I'm not complaining.

19:25.840 --> 19:28.460
That sick-girl cover story came in clutch.

19:31.290 --> 19:33.670
You got this, Miyo-chan!

19:38.280 --> 19:40.470
Momiji's killing it!

19:43.190 --> 19:45.370
Whoa! Asahi's on fire!

19:48.160 --> 19:50.460
Goal!

19:55.810 --> 19:58.490
How'd you get so fast, Asahi?

20:00.180 --> 20:02.320
Good job, guys!

20:03.770 --> 20:04.530
Thanks!

20:04.530 --> 20:05.600
Thank you!

20:17.030 --> 20:19.600
Hey, Miyo-chan. Thanks for earlier.

20:21.620 --> 20:23.330
Don't mention it.

20:27.750 --> 20:30.540
Do you have a spare with you?

20:30.540 --> 20:32.090
Let me know if you need to borrow one, okay?

20:33.930 --> 20:35.400
Borrow what?

20:36.030 --> 20:37.120
Spare of what?

20:41.260 --> 20:45.410
Hey, what are they talking about?

20:45.410 --> 20:47.180
Come on, Asahi.

20:47.170 --> 20:49.960
Come on, Momiji. Tell me!

20:47.180 --> 20:48.600
Let's go get changed.

20:49.960 --> 20:52.260
Why won't you tell me?! Come on!

21:01.330 --> 21:03.230
So that's what happened.

21:03.230 --> 21:05.880
I couldn't bring myself 
to correct her, you know?

21:08.010 --> 21:11.410
I gotta say, it's a pretty perfect 
way to get out of class, huh?

21:13.640 --> 21:15.420
I wouldn't do that if I were you.

21:15.420 --> 21:17.270
You'll be sorry when the time really comes.

21:21.150 --> 21:22.490
You have a point.

21:25.210 --> 21:28.170
Did anything else give you trouble?

21:29.140 --> 21:32.270
Getting changed for gym class 
was a little nerve-wracking.

21:32.270 --> 21:35.550
That, and people kept coming up to 
me during break asking questions,

21:35.550 --> 21:38.960
so I might have to flesh out 
the cover story you gave me.

21:38.960 --> 21:42.690
They seem to be buying it 
for the time being, though.

21:39.790 --> 21:42.580
<i>I'm glad he seems happy.</i>

21:42.580 --> 21:45.020
<i>Maybe middle school was 
a good idea, after all.</i>

21:45.520 --> 21:47.000
Oh, also!

21:47.000 --> 21:50.140
I noticed the guys stealing glances 
at me a couple times, too.

21:50.910 --> 21:53.680
What do you mean? Tell me more!

21:53.680 --> 21:56.700
Huh? W-Well, it was just an accident.

21:56.700 --> 21:57.700
An accident?!

21:57.700 --> 21:59.090
Yeah, in the boys' bathroom...

21:59.090 --> 22:00.080
The boys' bathroom?

22:00.080 --> 22:02.090
Th-Thanks for dinner!

22:02.090 --> 22:04.610
Hey, wait! Come back here!

23:35.090 --> 23:40.090
<b>Next Episode: Mahiro's Role-Playing Game</b>

23:35.090 --> 23:40.090
<b>Illustration: Akio Watanabe (Frontwing)</b>

23:38.510 --> 23:40.090
See you next time!
